# 모든 파이프라인 단계에 통과·실패·미검증 중 하나와 원문 메시지를 요구한다.
@prefix cc: <http://crowdcast.local/ont#> .
@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

cc:PipelineStageGateShape a sh:NodeShape ;
    sh:targetClass cc:PipelineStage ;
    sh:property [ sh:path cc:gateResult ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ;
        sh:datatype xsd:string ; sh:in ("passed" "failed" "unverified") ] ;
    sh:property [ sh:path cc:gateMessage ; sh:minCount 1 ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:string ] ;
    sh:property [ sh:path cc:gatePassed ; sh:maxCount 1 ; sh:datatype xsd:boolean ] ;
    sh:or (
        [ sh:property [ sh:path cc:gateResult ; sh:hasValue "passed" ] ;
          sh:property [ sh:path cc:gatePassed ; sh:hasValue true ] ]
        [ sh:property [ sh:path cc:gateResult ; sh:hasValue "failed" ] ;
          sh:property [ sh:path cc:gatePassed ; sh:hasValue false ] ]
        [ sh:property [ sh:path cc:gateResult ; sh:hasValue "unverified" ] ;
          sh:property [ sh:path cc:gatePassed ; sh:maxCount 0 ] ]
    ) ;
    sh:message "파이프라인 단계는 게이트 결과·메시지를 보존하고 미검증을 통과·실패와 구분해야 한다"@ko .
